# Gotchas

- **`middleware.ts` Clerk matcher** — changes affect auth for many routes; test carefully.
- **`await params`** — route `params` is a Promise in Next.js 15.
- **Lint is not repo-wide** — CI runs `eslint app lib components` only.
- **CI skips `main`** — pushes to `main` do not run this workflow (TM1-84).
- **`.cursorrules` is stale** — still lists Convex/Stripe/Upstash. Trust `AGENTS.md`, source code, and `ci.yml`.
- **`vault/`** also lives on `valgate-dev` — check before editing to avoid divergence.
- **No `ios/` tree** — AppCore/Xcode CI jobs skip in this repo.
